  "importPath": "@/components/ui/DateTimePicker",
  "description": "Floating calendar, date-range, preset, date-time, and 12h/24h time picker panels anchored to trigger inputs or action buttons.\n\nVariants:\n- Use=SingleCalendar: Single-date selection grid with Today and Confirm actions.\n- Use=DateRange: Two-endpoint range selection with start/end summary pills, active range band, Reset, and Apply Range actions.\n- Use=PresetCalendar: Two-column date picker pairing quick relative range presets (Today, Last 7 days, Last 30 days, This quarter, Year to date) with the monthly calendar.\n- Use=DateAndTime: Combined monthly calendar, inline hour/minute/period controls, and Schedule confirmation.\n- Use=TimePicker12h: 12-hour input fields with AM/PM toggle and quick time slot chips.\n- Use=TimePicker24h: 24-hour HH:MM:SS input controls with quick duration increment chips.\n\nRules:\n- Keep interactive footer action pairs as one secondary action (Outline XS: Today, Reset, Cancel, or Now) paired with one primary confirmation action (Primary XS). Never place two Primary buttons side-by-side.\n- Do not duplicate generic confirmation or form dialogs here; use Dialog for modal tasks and Date & Time Picker strictly for temporal selection.",
